Package: zurds
Title: Inspect and Safely Read R Serialization Files
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Pedro", "Baltazar", , "pedrobtz@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Reads the files R writes with saveRDS(), save() and
    serialize(), and lazy-load databases, without handing them to R's
    deserializer. It reports a file's header, lists the objects in an
    '.rda' file, summarises the structure of any stream, extracts a single
    object or list element, and scans for everything that can run code or
    reach outside the file, such as promises, closures and environments.
    Data-only files can be read with a reader written in C that builds
    only vectors, lists and attributes and never evaluates code from the
    file.
